<p style="font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:10px;color:#ffffff;">A message from NCTA - The Internet &amp; Television Association:</p>
<p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:20px;line-height:24px;color:#ffffff;"><strong style="font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-weight:bold;">Protect CBRS and don't let the Big 3 cellular companies dictate how Americans can connect.</strong> Despite what big cellular says, increasing power levels in CBRS will upend connectivity, investment, and operations across manufacturing, airports, schools, healthcare, agriculture, and more. <a href="https://url4027.email.politico.com/ss/c/u001.dgGKIUEMNqic94f5rSpPKCJCpfzLXKLU6KDtDs6qCfbTJD1ervaL6Qj-yGvuh4q9Zy1zItZSIdRfHKDZCb0miTwFI4lhBxomrwzdAEAH8aWAl4u-MJS41SsUSs3ZKiniNBhr8_iNJ7fRH_8_GOsKu7CrVu3PCzWE6_VInvbtCGMt_7VwvdajWb6HwlnjLd5M/4q5/cjlR280iQrO3XHmOtjnfNg/h7/h001.VogWO9CETGi58iAylZ6FvRpsKSUpczJYxrv6LU1O8wo" style="text-decoration:underline;color:#ffffff;" target="_blank">Don’t ruin America’s leading wireless innovation.</a></p>
