<p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:15px;line-height:15px;"><a href="https://url4027.email.politico.com/ss/c/u001.dgGKIUEMNqic94f5rSpPKCJCpfzLXKLU6KDtDs6qCfbTJD1ervaL6Qj-yGvuh4q9HH6cGArwJmq9BaT1xCRuRuqKNllnLLbZWarAFsebIYtFW3_yl8-dz3FFR_HtfcQEoZZSFJrZ--W2zLb2zOk0LJt2UeYMA2RDpjF_oDSR8upJFCeWgTQxXt5dBCk6HUMc/4q5/cjlR280iQrO3XHmOtjnfNg/h10/h001.WAYzzZ9nB0cUSo6fCDUB25OjuEWakhBL2gHHJHTTu14" target="_blank"><img alt="Advertisement Image" border="0" src="https://www.politico.com/dims4/default/735bfae/2147483647/resize/1000x/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fstatic.politico.com%2F0b%2Fb7%2Ff79a8e594d19829a464a7a3aa31c%2F500x500.jpg" style="width:100%;max-width:500px;" title="Advertisement Image" width="500"/></a> <img a="" border="0" src="https://ad.doubleclick.net/ddm/ad/N7384.146504POLITICO0/B35700818.445338752;sz=1x1;ord=[timestamp]"/></p>
